== Historical reference packages ==

Some older package pages remain useful as documentation, even though those packages are not in the current <code>mods/</code> folder. The World Editor belongs to this historical reference material. It is not a current Modloader preference or one of the two packages listed above.

Check a package's source and release notes before treating a historical page as a current feature.

